  "instructions": [
    "Heat the duck fat or avocado oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the garlic and cook, stirring occasionally, until fragrant, about 2 minutes.",
    "Stir in the harissa and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the diced red onion and cook, stirring occasionally, until translucent, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the frozen potatoes, salt, and black pepper to the skillet, stirring to combine.",
    "Cook, stirring occasionally, until the potatoes are tender and lightly browned, about 10 minutes.",
    "Stir in the chopped cilantro and ghee or coconut oil.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional cilantro if desired."
